  "title": "Engineer to Executive: Andrea White’s Path to Becoming Sonoco CHRO",
  "summary": "For Andrea White, finding career success never came from a desire to climb the ‘corporate ladder,’ rather, a need to solve challenges and voice solutions. ‘Fixing problems’ is where she found the most fulfillment, a mindset that led her up a winding path to becoming Sonoco’s Chief Human Resources Officer (CHRO) in March 2025, only the second woman to hold that position in the Company’s 125+ year history.",
